WEBVTT

01:01.600 --> 01:06.060
<i><b>The Glowing Island</b></i>

01:20.700 --> 01:22.830
<b>What's with that light?</b>

01:24.290 --> 01:25.710
<b>Isla del Fuego.</b>

01:26.920 --> 01:28.830
<b>Spanish for "Fire Island."</b>

01:29.380 --> 01:30.540
<b>Fire Island?</b>

01:32.510 --> 01:38.800
<b>The Spanish who colonized
the Philippines were scared of it.</b>

01:39.800 --> 01:41.810
<b>What're you talking about?</b>

01:42.310 --> 01:48.190
<b>The locals think there's all kind of black magic
rooted in Siquijor, and are afraid of it.</b>

01:49.520 --> 01:52.480
<b>Sounds like a perfect
hideout for them.</b>

02:40.990 --> 02:43.490
<b>I haven't had a pure-blood
guest in here before.</b>

02:44.160 --> 02:46.330
<b>It's a pleasure to make
your acquaintance.</b>

02:46.330 --> 02:48.710
<b>My name is Lucius Isaac.</b>

02:49.620 --> 02:54.840
<b>I am a messenger sent by
the nobility who rules the night.</b>

02:55.550 --> 02:57.920
<b>Pardon my uncouth entrance.</b>

02:58.880 --> 03:00.510
<b>What do you want?</b>

03:01.140 --> 03:02.410
<b>A warning.</b>

03:03.720 --> 03:10.690
<b>If your organization continues to expand,
the nobles will be forced to act.</b>

03:21.280 --> 03:23.640
<b>Of course,
that is simply a pretense.</b>

03:24.530 --> 03:31.960
<b>In all honesty, I have come because I'm interested
in the research performed by Deacon Frost,</b>

03:31.960 --> 03:35.880
<b>the head of Existence, the organization
which has taken hold of all Asia.</b>

03:36.710 --> 03:39.050
<b>I must say, conquering Asia...</b>

03:39.050 --> 03:42.430
<b>you've made an excellent
choice for your domain.</b>

03:42.430 --> 03:49.480
<b>It's a good lesson for the nobles, who think the world
begins and ends with their birthplace, Europe.</b>

03:50.480 --> 03:58.400
<b>Their inflated sense of self-worth and
superiority has given rise to persecution,</b>

03:58.400 --> 04:03.160
<b>which has led many of the world's turned
vampires to identify with Existence's goals.</b>

04:03.570 --> 04:06.700
<b>The world is not a singular place.</b>

04:06.700 --> 04:11.710
<b>Once the pure-bloods realize that,
they'll see their days are numbered.</b>

04:11.710 --> 04:18.170
<b>Their "Old World" methodology is going to be the
ruination of all vampires, unless something is done.</b>

04:18.550 --> 04:20.090
<b>Honestly...</b>

04:20.090 --> 04:25.720
<b>How have they not grown tired
of hiding from the humans?</b>

04:25.720 --> 04:27.720
<b>I'm not sure it will be
as simple as you think.</b>

04:28.220 --> 04:29.890
<b>Why's that?</b>

04:29.890 --> 04:34.810
<b>I can understand your vendetta, but it would
be wise not to underestimate the nobles.</b>

04:46.780 --> 04:50.910
<b>By experimenting with
assorted vampire phenotypes,</b>

04:50.910 --> 04:55.580
<b>I've created the "Golden Blood" that grants
power they've never dreamed of.</b>

04:55.580 --> 05:00.050
<b>Not only that, but I experimented
on my own body with it.</b>

05:00.050 --> 05:02.590
<b>In other words, I am the strongest
turned vampire in the world.</b>

05:03.380 --> 05:06.760
<b>I have nothing to fear
from you overfed pure-bloods.</b>

05:08.140 --> 05:10.560
<b>I merely shared
my concern with you...</b>

05:22.440 --> 05:24.150
<b>Hey, wait up.</b>

05:24.740 --> 05:26.200
<b>Could we slow down the pace?</b>

05:28.410 --> 05:29.280
<b>Dammit.</b>

05:41.750 --> 05:44.010
<b>What the hell was that thing?</b>

05:44.010 --> 05:44.590
<b>Let's go.</b>

05:51.350 --> 05:52.220
<b>What is this?</b>

05:53.930 --> 05:56.810
<b>One of the places where
my dream will be realized.</b>

05:59.440 --> 06:00.920
<b>And this...</b>

06:03.610 --> 06:04.860
<b>...is his blood.</b>

06:07.030 --> 06:08.530
<b>Things didn't go as I had hoped.</b>

06:09.280 --> 06:12.620
<b>It seems this won't be
enough to awaken it.</b>

06:24.050 --> 06:27.470
<b>I had hoped his blood would
have aided me with my goals,</b>

06:28.380 --> 06:33.930
<b>but it seems I must stoke him
until his blood boils, first.</b>

06:33.930 --> 06:37.560
<b>By doing that,
maybe he'll be of some use.</b>

06:39.140 --> 06:41.440
<b>You're going to toy with Blade?</b>

06:43.440 --> 06:47.030
<b>Well, if he can be killed by my subordinates,
that'll be the end of him.</b>

06:47.860 --> 06:49.450
<b>Then...</b>

06:51.950 --> 06:52.910
<b>The lights...</b>

06:54.240 --> 06:56.200
<b>But where's the entrance?</b>

07:00.750 --> 07:01.830
<b>That's it.</b>

07:13.600 --> 07:14.430
<b>Hey!</b>

07:28.030 --> 07:29.260
<b>What's the big idea!?</b>

07:31.110 --> 07:32.820
<b>We are Verdugo!</b>

07:32.820 --> 07:35.080
<b>Who are you?</b>

07:35.080 --> 07:36.830
<b>Verdugo?</b>

07:36.830 --> 07:38.700
<b>I've heard of you...</b>

07:38.700 --> 07:40.620
<b>you're Siquijor's guardians.</b>

07:40.620 --> 07:43.330
<b>We're vampire hunters!</b>

07:43.330 --> 07:45.090
<b>We came to this island because
we were tracking them!</b>

07:49.590 --> 07:50.840
<b>I apologize for my rudeness.</b>

07:54.140 --> 07:56.640
<b>I am Lupit of the Twin Swords.</b>

07:56.640 --> 07:59.180
<b>My family has acted as leader of
the Verdugo since ancient times.</b>

07:59.850 --> 08:01.940
<b>I'm Cimarron of the Double Spear.</b>

08:01.940 --> 08:04.860
<b>And this is Hagibis, our archer.</b>

08:04.860 --> 08:06.130
<b>Nice to meet you,</b>

08:06.870 --> 08:08.530
<b>miss beautiful vampire hunter.</b>

08:10.860 --> 08:15.620
<b>We're on the trail of
the legendary monster, Manananggal.</b>

08:15.950 --> 08:17.580
<b>Manananggal?</b>

08:17.580 --> 08:18.790
<b>Yeah.</b>

08:18.790 --> 08:22.620
<b>At night, it appears in the sky
and devours people.</b>

08:23.920 --> 08:27.090
<b>Our ancestors sealed it
within this mountain,</b>

08:27.090 --> 08:31.090
<b>but a group of dark beings led by a man
with four fangs unleashed it once more.</b>

08:31.090 --> 08:33.260
<b>The four-fanged man!?</b>

08:33.260 --> 08:36.090
<b>That's who we're after!</b>

08:36.090 --> 08:42.180
<b>The Verdugo are trained in the use of powerful white
magic, but they used nefarious dark magic.</b>

08:42.180 --> 08:44.190
<b>This island is in danger.</b>

08:44.980 --> 08:48.070
<b>It is our duty to protect this island.</b>

08:48.070 --> 08:50.940
<b>Please stay out of our way.</b>

08:51.610 --> 08:53.030
<b>Now hang on a second!</b>

08:53.030 --> 08:54.180
<b>We're here to...</b>

08:56.870 --> 08:57.620
<b>What!?</b>

09:00.240 --> 09:01.910
<b>I found the entrance.</b>

09:04.040 --> 09:05.600
<b>H-Hey!</b>

09:05.710 --> 09:06.960
<b>Wait up!</b>

09:06.960 --> 09:08.710
<b>What's with them?</b>

09:08.710 --> 09:10.670
<b>They're leaving...</b>

09:10.670 --> 09:13.880
<b>We must seal away the Manananggal
before anything else.</b>

09:13.880 --> 09:14.760
<b>Let's go!</b>

09:46.330 --> 09:47.420
<b>They're good...</b>

09:47.420 --> 09:49.840
<b>Leave the minions to
the vampire hunters.</b>

09:53.130 --> 09:54.800
<b>...I suppose we don't have that luxury.</b>

10:02.560 --> 10:06.060
<b>You seem to have a lot
of visitors tonight.</b>

10:06.060 --> 10:09.770
<b>The Daywalker himself has
probably found his way here.</b>

10:09.770 --> 10:12.480
<b>I'll get a new sample from him,
and then move out.</b>

10:13.530 --> 10:14.760
<b>What will you do?</b>

10:15.820 --> 10:21.580
<b>You appear to be a greater threat to the
pure-bloods than I even imagined.</b>

10:22.660 --> 10:28.370
<b>But, personally,
I'd like to see what you do next.</b>

10:28.370 --> 10:30.330
<b>Your actions...</b>

10:30.330 --> 10:32.380
<b>and your plans for Existence.</b>

10:34.460 --> 10:36.280
<b>Do what you want.</b>

10:59.570 --> 11:01.700
<b>Deacon Frost!</b>

11:14.040 --> 11:16.610
<b>So that's the Daywalker...</b>

11:21.050 --> 11:23.720
<b>You've improved a little,</b>

11:23.720 --> 11:27.310
<b>but not nearly enough to beat me.</b>

11:45.830 --> 11:48.250
<b>You're still far too weak,</b>

11:56.340 --> 12:01.090
<b>but hopefully now,
your blood will prove useful.</b>

12:07.850 --> 12:08.560
<b>Hey!</b>

12:09.730 --> 12:10.480
<b>You alright!?</b>

12:23.240 --> 12:24.550
<b>Disgusting...</b>

12:24.950 --> 12:26.370
<b>It split...</b>

12:26.370 --> 12:27.330
<b>in two!?</b>

12:29.620 --> 12:30.540
<b>Manananggal!</b>

12:32.160 --> 12:33.330
<b>That's it?</b>

12:33.330 --> 12:34.080
<b>Let's move!</b>

12:35.380 --> 12:36.710
<b>What's with this thing?!</b>

12:36.710 --> 12:38.090
<b>It's bigger than I heard!</b>

12:38.630 --> 12:39.550
<b>Don't back down!</b>

12:42.170 --> 12:45.050
<b>Abomination born of
the eternal darkness...</b>

12:45.050 --> 12:48.310
<b>In the name of the holy
white spirit, begone!</b>

13:10.340 --> 13:11.020
<b>Let's finish it.</b>

13:18.500 --> 13:19.380
<b>Cimarron!</b>

13:23.920 --> 13:25.260
<b>Goddammit!</b>

13:25.260 --> 13:26.760
<b>Why wasn't it sealed away!?</b>

13:32.220 --> 13:33.390
<b>What are you doing'?</b>

13:41.320 --> 13:43.030
<b>Stop!</b>

13:54.910 --> 13:55.710
<b>You...</b>

13:55.710 --> 13:56.410
<b>those eyes...</b>

13:56.410 --> 13:57.750
<b>This is bad news!</b>

14:04.010 --> 14:05.920
<b>How amusing!</b>

14:09.180 --> 14:10.470
<b>Dammit.</b>

14:11.050 --> 14:11.970
<b>Come on!</b>

14:25.490 --> 14:26.990
<b>I'll fight.</b>

14:26.990 --> 14:27.950
<b>I'll fulfill my brother's...</b>

14:27.950 --> 14:29.220
<b>Hagibis' duty...</b>

14:30.320 --> 14:34.620
<b>Well said, Danas, sister of Hagibis.</b>

14:34.620 --> 14:39.580
<b>From now on you are
a proud warrior of the Verdugo.</b>

14:49.380 --> 14:54.760
<b><i>I may have gotten used to it,
but the side effects are still hell...</i></b>

14:54.760 --> 14:58.770
<b><i>But this should keep the bloodthirst
under control for a few days.</i></b>

15:00.850 --> 15:01.520
<b>You.</b>

15:04.320 --> 15:05.280
<b>What are you?</b>

15:13.580 --> 15:18.500
<b>When one from the deepest darkness appears,
the great calamity will rise again...</b>

15:19.500 --> 15:21.770
<b>Are you one of the dark ones,
like them?</b>

15:25.380 --> 15:28.420
<b>Danas lost her brother Hagibis...</b>

15:28.420 --> 15:29.470
<b>I...</b>

15:32.050 --> 15:34.550
<b>I lost my betrothed, Cimarron.</b>

15:40.190 --> 15:43.270
<b>Woman, why are you
with this monster?</b>

15:44.110 --> 15:46.520
<b>He's not a monster.</b>

15:46.520 --> 15:48.030
<b>Then what is he!?</b>

15:48.610 --> 15:49.740
<b>He's...</b>

15:50.570 --> 15:51.610
<b>he's...</b>

15:51.610 --> 15:54.070
<b>I'm a Daywalker.</b>

15:54.990 --> 15:56.370
<b>Daywalker?</b>

15:57.660 --> 16:00.710
<b>The hybrid that has
their cursed blood?</b>

16:02.000 --> 16:04.420
<b>What I am doesn't matter.</b>

16:05.000 --> 16:08.050
<b>That four-fanged man,
Deacon Frost,</b>

16:08.050 --> 16:11.050
<b>is using science to
strengthen vampires.</b>

16:11.630 --> 16:14.430
<b>You can't beat Manananggal
alone anymore.</b>

16:15.220 --> 16:16.810
<b>Use me.</b>

16:16.810 --> 16:17.450
<b>Silence!</b>

16:17.890 --> 16:19.980
<b>I won't accept the help of
a spawn of darkness!</b>

16:20.980 --> 16:25.810
<b>Without that dark power,
you don't have a chance.</b>

16:25.810 --> 16:30.320
<b>And this fight is
between me and Frost...</b>

16:33.910 --> 16:36.200
<b>Manananggal is coming!</b>

16:38.030 --> 16:39.790
<b>It's headed this way!</b>

16:42.500 --> 16:44.790
<b>All of you,
evacuate into the jungle!</b>

16:46.790 --> 16:48.880
<b>Back there, I...</b>

16:48.880 --> 16:49.420
<b>What?</b>

16:49.920 --> 16:51.260
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

16:51.260 --> 16:52.170
<b>Don't worry about it.</b>

16:52.590 --> 16:54.380
<b>You're part of the team.</b>

16:55.970 --> 16:57.760
<b>What's that supposed to mean?</b>

16:58.640 --> 16:59.810
<b>That's weird...</b>

17:01.270 --> 17:03.100
<b>I need to ask you a favor.</b>

17:10.360 --> 17:11.780
<b>Goddammit!</b>

17:11.780 --> 17:13.820
<b>Why do I have to be the bait!?</b>

17:14.990 --> 17:15.570
<b>Here it is!</b>

17:16.990 --> 17:18.280
<b>Gross!</b>

17:19.080 --> 17:20.660
<b>Asshole!</b>

17:22.040 --> 17:23.200
<b>Here it comes!</b>

17:49.610 --> 17:51.230
<b>You two were alive!?</b>

17:51.230 --> 17:53.190
<b>Cimarron, Hagibis...</b>

18:05.870 --> 18:07.000
<b>What are you doing'?</b>

18:07.000 --> 18:07.620
<b>Move!</b>

18:13.800 --> 18:18.720
<b>When one from the deepest darkness appears,
the great calamity will rise again...</b>

18:19.640 --> 18:23.310
<b>However, I shall never
cease my prayers.</b>

18:23.310 --> 18:26.520
<b>The white spirit is with me...</b>

18:27.270 --> 18:28.900
<b>Holy white spirit...</b>

18:28.900 --> 18:30.310
<b>sacred island...</b>

18:31.310 --> 18:34.030
<b>Grant your children your power!</b>

18:36.150 --> 18:36.950
<b>Shit!</b>

19:12.810 --> 19:13.900
<b>Amazing...</b>

19:21.990 --> 19:22.780
<b>Danas...</b>

19:27.410 --> 19:28.870
<b>Hagibis...</b>

19:34.880 --> 19:36.170
<b>Spirit!</b>

19:36.170 --> 19:37.920
<b>Protect us!</b>

20:04.990 --> 20:08.140
THE
SECOND
BLADE

20:05.580 --> 20:08.140
<i>PHANTOM
MOON</i>

20:17.710 --> 20:18.920
<b>Blade...</b>

20:19.590 --> 20:24.010
<b>The key to Frost's ambitions, who holds
the fate of the nobles' lives in his hands...</b>

20:24.010 --> 20:26.470
<b>The only living Daywalker.</b>

20:26.470 --> 20:30.100
<b>You have proven to be
quite interesting.</b>

20:52.430 --> 20:53.560
<b>This is...</b>

20:54.760 --> 20:57.060
<b>the spirit?</b>

20:57.840 --> 20:58.540
<b>Yes.</b>

20:59.750 --> 21:02.380
<b>They protected us.</b>

21:10.220 --> 21:11.960
<b>Deacon Frost...</b>

21:12.980 --> 21:16.400
<b>I'll follow you wherever you go.</b>

21:16.400 --> 21:22.280
<b>I'm gonna end this chain of
suffering you're causing.</b>

23:04.800 --> 23:09.070
<b>I find that frustrated
expression quite amusing.</b>

23:10.510 --> 23:15.430
<b>Enjoy the full extent of this power
that Master Frost has given me.</b>

23:18.730 --> 23:20.850
<b>Turn a vampire...</b>

23:20.850 --> 23:23.310
<b>back into a human?</b>

23:25.860 --> 23:31.070
<i><b>The Witch Doctor</b></i>

23:26.050 --> 23:30.150
<b>Next time on Blade: The Witch Doctor.</b>
